From 9d172c765bf2ec3639210320cb388e5a07885744 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 23:09:36 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-42: DFM properties by name / by category / in the
 .dfm's own order (0.42.0)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

WPF's Properties window arranges by Name or by Category. The DFM properties
table now has three buttons:
- 依名稱 (the default, as before: A-Z)
- 依類別: 版面 / 外觀 / 行為 / 其他 groups (by the property's first part,
  Font.Size -> Font), each with its count
- DFM 順序: as BCB6 wrote them in the .dfm (by line: Left, Top, Width,
  Height, Caption ...); one without a line keeps its place at the end
The choice is remembered (the panel's state); the search box works in all.

Test: panels_render (A-Z by default with the button marked; the .dfm order
starts Left, Top, Width, Height, Caption for spbSave; by category the
layout group comes first with Left / Width and no row is lost; back to
by name).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
